[Job_Descrip]
Janitor=Janitors are tasked with keeping the prison clean.#Sweep and mop the grime and dirt from around the halls of the prison complex.
Laundry=It is the responsibility of laundry workers to wash prisoner and guard outfits.#Take the dirty outfits and place them in the washers. Once complete, place the resulting clean outfits in the correct container.
Kitchen=Kitchen workers have the duty of preparing prison meals.#This involves first taking uncooked food from the freezer and cooking it in the oven. Once it's cooked, place it on the serving trays.
Woodshop=Woodshop workers have the job of crafting furniture for sale on the outside.#Take three timbers from the woodpile and place all of them in the crafting menu to craft a chair. Put completed furniture in the assigned container.
Metalshop=Workers in the metalshop are tasked with creating license plates for sale on the outside.#Use the sheet metal on the print press to create a license plate. Place completed plates back in the assigned container.
Rejected=Unfortuanately your application was rejected.#You need at least $int% intellect to be eligible for the $job job. You can raise your intellect by reading in the library.
Rejected2=Unfortunately your application was rejected.#Learn to respect the basic prison rules before applying for work. Try again later.
Approved=Congratulations, your job application was approved.#If you fail to meet quota during a work period, the job will be removed.                                                                                    